-- -> pick ONE buff -> coins fly out of your body to pay. Not enough coins = you float into the sky and die.
-- Every 3rd summon (3, 6, 9...) is a golden SUPER shop: stronger buffs, plus the Missile ability and its upgrades.
-- Secret coin phrase is COIN_PHRASE below (owner only).

